<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>By total coincidence, <a href="/scp-1926-r">SCP-1926-R</a> was declared a hoax by O5-7. But which one? And why?</p>
<p>The connection to Dark and SCP-006 completely fits my (non-canon, of course) &quot;bio&quot; of Mr. Dark. Which is to say: Marshall and Carter are hereditary partners, but Dark is the original Dark &#8212; he has some SCP-equivalent that has slowed or stopped his aging. Why is Dark old in my tales about him, you ask?</p>
<p>&#8212; maybe his SCP only slows aging<br />
&#8212; perhaps he was fairly old when he got his hands on it<br />
